<<
/Title (SQL injection is a vulnerability where an application places user input directly inside a database query without sanitising it first. An attacker can insert SQL code into the input field to change the behaviour of the query. In this case, I was able to comment out the password check entirely and log in as admin without knowing the password.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 729 0 R
>>
endobj
